ated and powerless  i think a lot of us have become jaded  and selfish and  getting and protecting what what we feel  like is ours  there's a lot of mistrust in today's  world a lot of cynicism  that's why civility is decreasing and  i want to take this time to remind all  of us of that american spirit that that  america is built upon that has changed  the world  i want to remind all of us  that of that power  of togetherness of unity  that can make the world a much better  place  i want to remind you that in this year  things are going to come up  things are going to  hit you and  twists and turns are going to come  but adjust  ask for help  don't give up  and together  in 2022  with a sense of unity and purpose  we can make life better  and we muster up that spirit  that america was built upon that spirit  of unity that spirit of  passion and power and  purposefulness  we can make america what it is intended  to be  and  i'll be able to build this center  on the south side of chicago  to help a whole lot of people  god bless you and happy new year  you

